    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      414.49,
      540.02,
      513.16
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Sub-section (3) of Section 2 of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal MattersAct, No. 25 of 2002, I, Wijeyadasa Rajapakshe, Minister of Justice do by this Order, declare that the provisions of theaforesaid Act shall apply in respect of the Agreement between the Government of the Democratic Socialist Republicof Sri Lanka and the Government of the Russian Federation made at St. Petersburg on the Twenty Eighth day of MayTwo Thousand and Fifteen. This Agreement which was made between the Government of Sri Lanka and the Government ofthe Russian Federation, which is a Non- Commonwealth Country, deals with mutual legal assistance in criminal mattersand concerns inter alia the improved effectiveness on the part of both parties to the Agreement through cooperation inrelation to combating crimes including terrorism within their respective Jurisdictions.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
